    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"When and how often do youth receive technical violations?\"\nformat: html\n---\n\n\n**When and how often do youth receive technical violations?**  \n\n* What is the average time to a first technical violation on a supervision episode? How does this vary across race/ethnicity, sex, and risk level? \n\n* What is the average number of technical violations that occur during a probation episode? How does this vary across race/ethnicity, sex, and risk level?  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n# 1. Average Time to First Technical Violation\n\n**NOTE:** There are two possibilities for exploring time to technical violation:\n\n* **CURRENTLY** using `supervision_start_first_tech_violation_first_overall` (from `violation_filed_date`) if we are only looking at first technical violations that were also first overall violations (QUESTION: use with `violation_technical_flag` filter?) \n\n* Alternatively, we could also instead use `supervision_start_first_tech_violation_any` (from `min_technical_violation_date`) to explore first technical violations even if following new offense violation (i.e., the first technical violation for an episode even if it occurs after a separate new offense violation)\n\n<br>\n\n## Table 1. By FY: Time to First Technical Violation\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n`````{=html}\n<table class=\"table table-striped table-hover table-condensed table-responsive\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">\n <thead>\n  <tr>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> FY of Completion </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Average Time to First Technical Violation (Mean) </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Average Time to First Technical Violation (Median) </th>\n  </tr>\n </thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2018 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 191.4859 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 163.0 </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2019 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 182.0631 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 150.0 </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2020 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 178.3333 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 139.0 </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2021 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 223.4626 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 196.0 </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2022 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 211.6045 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 169.5 </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;font-weight: bold;\"> Overall </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;font-weight: bold;\"> 191.6321 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;font-weight: bold;\"> 158.0 </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n`````\n:::\n:::\n\n\n<br>\n\n## Table 2. By Race/Ethnicity: Time to First Technical Violation\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n`````{=html}\n<table class=\"table table-striped table-hover table-condensed table-responsive\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">\n <thead>\n  <tr>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Race/Ethnicity </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Average Time to First Technical Violation (Mean) </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Average Time to First Technical Violation (Median) </th>\n  </tr>\n </thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> Asian </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 327.0000 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 377.0 </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> Black </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 197.1619 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 158.5 </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> Hispanic </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 186.4067 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 158.0 </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:c